<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador bank liquidity up 1.34 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>Ecuador bank liquidity up 1.34 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's Central Bank said Thursday liquidity in the bank system grew 1.34 percent, or 217 million sucres, to 16.31 billion sucres in November.</p>
<p>At the end of October, bank liquidity stood at 16.10 billion sucres.</p>
<p>Total liquidity in the bank sector ended 1995 at 12.51 billion sucres, up 41.2 percent from 1994.</p>
<p>--Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433</p>
</text>
